==Bulgarian==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|sla-pro|bg}} {{m|sla-pro|*uxo}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|bg}} {{m|ine-pro|*h₂ous-}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/uˈxɔ/|lang=bg}}

===Noun===
{{bg-noun|g=n|sc=Cyrl|tr=uhó}}

# {{context|anatomy|lang=bg}} [[ear]]
# [[eye]] (of a needle)
# [[lug]] (a part of something which sticks out, used as a handle or support)
# [[mouldboard]]

====Inflection====
{{bg-decl-noun|g=n|уши|ухото|ушите}}

